  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. Mouse Without Borders doesn't support Android phones today. The main tracking ticket is PowerToys#26296, and PowerToys#33575 was closed as a duplicate of it. Please add a thumbs-up or any extra context there instead of opening a new request. In the meantime, scrcpy can show and control an Android device from your PC, but it works by screen mirroring, not by moving the cursor between devices. Barrier and Synergy let you share a mouse and keyboard across computers, but the tickets say they don't cover Android."
